{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_franka_set_2_story_1","groupId":"story_franka_set_2","stageId":null,"title":"駐足","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_franka_2_1.txt","sourceHash":"920bf3bac368bc45c83a11222e1688905d84c0e89db337ba44f85828fe425da4","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"身邊的人都在不斷前進，她也該做出屬於她的選擇了。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"香草，你在這裡做什麼，這裡不是……潔西卡的宿舍嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，芙蘭卡前輩！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我在幫潔西卡收拾房間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……也是，我們勇敢的大小姐去了拓荒地，往後的日子就不能經常待在本艦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我和潔西卡說好了，我幫忙收拾她的房間，再幫她把東西寄過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"需要我幫忙嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"不用，我去工程部借了一些裝置，這點事情，我一個人就足夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個過自動門都會撞到的小姑娘，如今也成長了嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蘭卡前輩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得，潔西卡錯了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是她讓你來問的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是的，明明做出了那種決定，卻還是擔心前輩對她的看法……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也不知道她是不是真的長進了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"……我覺得潔西卡很厲害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"她願意拋下自己的那些東西……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，不用急著幫她說話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"潔西卡有不少問題，但她總是知道自己在做什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從一開始就知道，她不是需要擔心的那種人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是我沒想到，她做出決定的時間——會這麼早。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"早……嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，她才二十歲出頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她還有許多時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"唔……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，這也不是壞事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起那些無法做出決定的人，潔西卡已經比他們強太多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"我也一直在思考自己的未來，但是一直無法做出決定，所以……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噗……不，我不是在說你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也還很年輕，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說的是……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我說的是誰呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就去找信使寄東西了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"任務？我知道了，我馬上就到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在任務結束之後，找一些消遣，然後等待下一個任務。\n這並沒有什麼問題。\n她這麼想著，正打算離開房間，一個聲音卻讓她停下了腳步。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我的意願沒有改變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的願望依然是創立一家屬於我自己的保全公司。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克里夫先生想要和我談談？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白，明天我會啟程返回總部一趟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說芙蘭卡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"放到往常，她會毫不在意地走到自己的搭檔面前對她擠眉弄眼。\n要是她的心情再好一些，說不定還會做一些好玩的惡作劇。\n但是今天——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她知道我的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會和她討論這件事的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我在躲什麼呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (B)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蘭卡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (B)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你來得正好，我要回總部一趟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？發生了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (B)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和你提過的，我打算去和克里夫先生聊聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你終於下定決心了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (B)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，潔西卡那麼勇敢，我覺得……我也應該再勇敢一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"勇敢不代表無謀，你真的覺得自己已經準備好面對那個“橋夾”了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是你覺得應付不來，我陪你去也可以哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (B)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不，我總得習慣這種事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這種心直口快的性格，對上那個陰險的老傢伙，可是會被吃得死死的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (B)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蘭卡，你今天心情不好，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這和我有什麼關係？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (B)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"整天應付你，我覺得，我還是鍛鍊了一些看人的本事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇哦，我們的優等生小姐也長大了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (B)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蘭卡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (B)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我回來，我想和你聊聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"認真的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (B)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"認真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (B)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我大概要去一個月，回見。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，看來我的心情確實有點糟糕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"匯報情況。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"和前期情報一致，這群盜匪綁架了運輸站的工作人員，並且佔領了那裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"他們的人數不少，裝備也不差，但是戒備不算森嚴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我已經摸清了建築的結構和他們安插的點位，現在發送給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"呼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"唉，我原本還在好奇，你和雷蛇這樣的精英被派去醫藥公司是不是有點大材小用了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"現在我算是明白了，原來要做的事情沒有什麼變化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也可以申請去後勤部或者人事部，不用來受這個罪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"那可不行，外勤幹員的待遇比我在黑鋼時要好呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"而且，我早就想試試這種崗位了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前線可不是好玩的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"所以我才主動申請和兩位前輩一起出任務嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"想必一定可以從優秀的前輩身上學到許多東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戰場的知識可沒什麼好學的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不會一輩子在戰場上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"對我而言，這些都是能賺錢的知識！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"在能賺錢的時候多賺一點，然後我就可以去做想做的事情了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想做的事情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"嘿嘿，其實我還沒想好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"但我覺得我會想到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，年輕真好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"你也沒比我大到哪裡去吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論是在黑鋼，還是在羅德島，我都是你的前輩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"那您需不需要我來幫忙捶背揉肩呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"免了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，我已經制定好作戰計劃了，現在發送給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"這麼快？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"嗚哇，好詳細！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓你別小看前輩的實力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我倒是從來沒有小看過您老人家就是了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"分兩隊，A隊負責正面牽制，B隊負責救援人質。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"正面牽制的人數會不會太少了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根據之前的情報，他們的頭目很警覺，人數多的話，他們很有可能選擇逃跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓他們逃進山裡就麻煩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"可是，這個A隊人數……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是有人囑咐過你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“因為雷蛇不在，所以你要多關注芙蘭卡，不要讓她衝動行事。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"唔。事先聲明……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然不是雷蛇本人說的，我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的優等生小姐，會直接告訴我這一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過也是，我們拍檔的時間，也有點太久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"久到連羅德島發布任務的時候，也總是會把我們放到一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"這難道不是好事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得這是好事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"嗯——身邊有個好伙伴總是讓人放心的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"芙蘭卡會在戰場上因為尋求刺激而採取一些危險的行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"而雷蛇出於安全考量，會用各種方式制止她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"雖然她們經常鬥嘴，但作戰時合作無間，總是能夠出色地完成任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我在黑鋼時，就已經聽說過你們二人組了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (C)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和她都已經習慣了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"沃爾珀女性嘆了口氣。\n在進入黑鋼的時候，大部分人都會選擇一把制式武器。\n她雖然挑了一把制式短刺劍防身，但依然堅持使用自己的迅捷劍作為主要武器。\n時間久了，許多人都以為她只會使用那把迅捷劍。\n但實際上，她的短刺劍也用得很好。\n而現在，就連她自己也快忘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，速戰速決。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多虧了芙蘭卡在正面牽制，我和其他隊友順利把人質救了出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是等我一回頭，就看到他們把芙蘭卡給堵住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"欸！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我當時心都跳到嗓子眼了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然對方的裝備不算多麼精良，但是，他們畢竟人多勢眾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，他們意識到自己受到芙蘭卡的戲弄，一個個都恨不得剝了她的皮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但芙蘭卡卻悠哉悠哉地站在那裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我心想，完了完了，難道雷蛇不在，芙蘭卡打算放飛一下自我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在這時——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"就在這時？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼，這可是獨家新聞，想知道的話，可要付出一點代價。"},{"type":"narration","text":"杏仁比了一個錢的手勢，露出奸詐的笑容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"……好、好吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎喲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用別人的故事賺錢可不好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這叫合理利用資源！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，雷蛇你回來啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (C)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (C)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在說芙蘭卡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (C)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我也聽一聽吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧好吧，今天就當作是免費大放送好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，這下搞得我反而有些罪惡感了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，說時遲那時快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蘭卡身處戰場中央，而我則剛剛運送完人質，站在塔樓上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們並沒有制定嚴格的時間表，她應該是不知道我的位置的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是在那時，芙蘭卡卻精準地向我遞了一個眼神。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個眼神引導我看向另一邊，那邊，有一座危樓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而危樓附近，恰好是那群盜匪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我瞬間明白了她的意思——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她並不是因為莽撞而出現在了他們面前，她是故意引誘他們到達那個位置的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而連我會出現在那個位置她都料到了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (C)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她可沒有那麼神通廣大，只是算算時間，你或者其他隊員也該出現了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那要是我們因為一些狀況而沒有出現呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (C)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她大概會去和你們會合，或許她也有第二手準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (C)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是我的話，可能會在危樓上事先安置炸藥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼說來，芙蘭卡確實事先問我要了一些炸藥……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總覺得，這次任務中的芙蘭卡，和之前的感覺並不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沉穩、可靠……雖然她平時也很可靠，但是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (C)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她人呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"香草","speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","isRemote":false,"text":"好像出任務回來後，她就把自己關在房間裡了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杏仁","speakerId":"avg_4105_almond_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我還想找她慶祝一下呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (C)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我去找她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杏仁那個多嘴的傢伙，現在大概在到處說吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，算了，隨她去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"桌邊，母親寄來的那封信依然完好地放在那裡。\n她會準時地給母親寄錢，也會熱情地回覆母親的每一個問題，她很愛自己的母親。\n但是有兩個問題她始終避而不談——\n你想要從事傭兵這麼危險的職業到什麼時候？\n你什麼時候回家？\n這兩個問題其實是一個問題。\n她相信母親只是出於單純的母愛才如此反覆地提示，但對她而言，這兩個問題蘊含的意義比任何人想像的都要重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"沃爾珀女性打開從可頌那裡買來的二手唱片機，而後，將自己砸入柔軟的床裡。\n像是想要投入一個沒有人認識自己的深淵。\n她從不認為自己沒有做好準備。\n她認為自己在享受當下的每一分每一秒。\n但是，當潔西卡決定前往拓荒地，當雷蛇決定成立自己的保全公司時，她感到了一種失落。\n這種失落並非對未來的迷茫，她不是不知道自己該何去何從。\n而是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"有節奏且有禮貌的敲門聲，她知道是誰。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她知道我在房間裡，所以她會找到我藏備用鑰匙的地方。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對，就是門邊的花盆下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後，她就會毫不猶豫地打開門。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，下次我還是換一個放鑰匙的地方吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (B)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (B)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蘭卡，這可不像你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼樣才算像我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (B)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……至少不是現在這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"優等生小姐，現在有空嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (B)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我沒有空，就不會來找你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是不是有一段時間沒有對練過了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_trainingcom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以說，你還是一本正經地把你的理想全部說了一遍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (B)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟除此之外，我不知道別的做法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，比起逼你說一些冠冕堂皇的話，這樣確實更加適合你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，結果如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (B)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不怎麼樣，克里夫先生並不看好我的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (B)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，他也說，他並不介意多一個偏遠的合作伙伴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (A)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"婉轉的說法——保全公司之間沒有真正的合作可言，一旦你脫離了黑鋼，你和黑鋼就不可能是朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (B)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"兩人一邊聊著，一邊走向訓練場的兩端。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你應該聽羅拉說了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我大概能理解為什麼你會忽然找我對練。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天我會奉陪到你滿意為止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"優等生小姐，你最近是不是有點太得意忘形了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是故意這麼說的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"劍刃與盾牌碰撞，發出激烈的聲響。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，我還去見了幾個從訓練生時期一直保持聯絡的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們有不少人願意跟我一起出來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來你是回去參加“同學會”的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算不上，只是和他們聚了聚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們都提到了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟，雖然你總是喊我“優等生”，但每次都拿第一、所有同屆受訓兵印象裡最優秀的人是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對一個戰士來說，“優等生”可不是什麼讚美之詞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我呢，我從第一眼看到你，就看你不順眼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還記得我們兩個第一次在模擬訓練時對上的情景。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我當時是怎麼說的來著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說，“讓我看看優等生在實戰裡是不是也是優等生吧”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你從那天起就開始叫我“優等生”了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼記仇？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以從現在開始放棄叫我這個綽號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可不行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"兩人對於對方的招式都無比熟悉，兵器碰撞聲一時間填滿了整個房間。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟，像你這樣既不是野心家，又不是軍火販子的人，來當僱傭兵，實在是個怪胎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到今天，我也還是這麼想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不想被嘴上說著因為尋求刺激而成為僱傭兵的人評頭論足啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"變得越來越會說話了嘛，優等生小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多虧你教得好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才進房間的時候，我看到了那封信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這幾年一直沒有回去過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟，我不知道見面的話應該和她說些什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得你和你母親的關係並不差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何止不差，我很愛我的母親，她也很愛我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她鼓勵我去做自己想做的事，也不會強迫我做任何不想做的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的性格呢，其實就是被她這樣慣出來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看得出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"僅從性格而言，僱傭兵裡和我類似的人有很多……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是像你這樣，能夠在戰鬥中汲取樂趣，比起迴避危險，更樂於享受的反而是少數。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也是花了很長時間才能理解這件事的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為你沒有後顧之憂，所以你反而可以成為這樣的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我真該給你看看我小時候的照片。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是我自誇，但你可能不會見到比那時的我更加像富家小姐的孩子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，還是算了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呿，就算你想看，我也不知道還有沒有……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，媽媽肯定還保存著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，反正，我越是享受著我手中的一切，就越是害怕見到她——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不應該遠行的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我應該陪在她的身邊，開一家小店，收入能夠應付生活支出就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我卻無法克制自己對……這一切的嚮往。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"芙蘭卡指了指手中的劍，而後轉身看了一圈這座規模並不小的訓練場。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在做自由傭兵的時期，她已經很擔心我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我準備出發的那一天，她笑著把我送上了開往黑鋼訓練營的車。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我知道，等車開遠了，她一定會哭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怕見到她，你會無法離開嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我怕我會不由自主地和她爭吵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明我很愛她，明明她很愛我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……原本我以為你只是心情不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來，你的心情是很不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼多年下來，這是你第一次說這麼多話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，從來都是你在那裡說，我負責嘲笑你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，難道你的病情惡化了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心吧，我的病情沒什麼大礙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不會變好，也沒有變得更糟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經開始習慣洗澡時摸到那些結晶的觸感了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許是我瘋了，誰知道呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我並不認為人一定要擁有遠大的理想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對我而言，從戰鬥中感受到自己一步一步的成長，從捉弄身邊的人那裡獲得一點微不足道的趣味——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得已經足夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從黑鋼到羅德島，大部分時候我都過得很愉快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得，我是能夠一直這樣下去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到潔西卡，直到你，你們都做出了自己的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我才發現，其實並不是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不由自主地問自己——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我該何去何從呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蘭卡，你總是能把所有事情做好，你是許多人憧憬的對象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也包括我在內。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……等等，你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個第一次出任務就在戰場上把我攔下來的傢伙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這和以我的標準判斷你的作戰風格太過危險，並不衝突。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一直以來，我都不太清楚我為什麼會和你成為搭檔，但是最近我逐漸想明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論你是怎麼想的，但我一直想要知道……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像你這樣和我完全不同的人，究竟是怎麼看待人生的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許是直覺告訴我，我會從你身上學到許多東西吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不覺得你有從我身上學到什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很多東西，戰鬥技巧、語言藝術，還有一點……樂觀的心態？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，這些與其說是學到的，不如說是為了跟上你的腳步而磨練自己得來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像你和羅拉一起出的那次任務……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是芙蘭卡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看起來需要一個支撐，但你並不是真的需要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你需要的只是有人推你一把。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這算是某種決裂宣言？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是想告訴你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不用太顧慮我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我現在發現，你真的越來越擅長讓我生氣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多虧你教得好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"鋁熱劍脫手而出，在空中劃過一道危險的弧線，而閃光盾也從瓦伊凡的手中不受控制地滑落。\n平局，一如既往。\n但芙蘭卡並沒有像往常一樣，一邊開雷蛇的玩笑，一邊過去撿起武器。\n她呆立在原地，像是在思考些什麼。\n而雷蛇彷彿也是在等待著她一樣。\n片刻後，她終於開口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說想和我聊一聊的事……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是邀請我去你未來想要成立的保全公司，是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暫時不會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"雷蛇撿起鋁熱劍，芙蘭卡撿起閃光盾，然後，互相丟給對方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的病情已經差不多穩定了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我打算請個長假，先回家看看媽媽，陪陪她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許會和她吵一架。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後……或許我會出個遠門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接一點長期外派的任務什麼的，去遠一點的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許等我回來的時候，你的新公司已經成立了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到時候我可以請你來坐坐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也別高興得太早。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當初，是你擅自跟著我來到羅德島。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說不定哪天，我在羅德島待不下去了，就會死皮賴臉地去你的公司賴著了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起人情，我更看重規矩，你知道的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我到時候只好在你公司樓下立個牌子再打個地舖，再在上面寫一些你的糗事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……唉，我怎麼會認識你這種人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，你怎麼會認識我這種人，真為你感到遺憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"中午吃點什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰請客？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇 (A)","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡 (B)","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行吧，今天我請。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_240_Vanilla","aliases":["芙蘭卡","香草"]}]}
